Description: lh-modbus - Modbus Industrial Register Slew-Rate Boundary Invariant
 Zero-dependency Go industrial Modbus TCP Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) firewall dissecting 7-byte MBAP headers and PDUs, enforcing physical register setpoint/slew-rate bounds, RTU CRC-16, and OT/SCADA posture auditing.
